@KAN-7
Feature: KAN-7 - Inventory stock becomes negative when adding a quantity that exceeds the maximum supported Java Integer value (Integer.MAX_VALUE).

  @R1
  Scenario: Add normal stock quantity succeeds without overflow
    Given the request header "Content-Type" is "application/json"
    And the request body is:
      """
      {
        "quantity" : 1,
        "reason" : "normal add"
      }
      """
    When I send a POST request to "/api/inventory/1/add"
    Then the response status class is 2xx
    And the response JSON "availableQuantity" is not empty

